Added an **Update all** dashboard action on `u`.

- `internal/ui/dashboard.go:189` starts the run, then updates apps one at a time via `Application.Update`, which pulls and only redeploys when the image changed. The progress line and the panel chip name the current app (`Updating <host>` / `updating...`).
- Failures are logged and the run continues with the next app; the queue/state is reset when done.
- Tests cover sequencing, naming, and reuse of the per-app path; `DashboardPanel.View` now takes a busy label instead of a bool.

